      {
        "pid": "exp-q1",
        "html": "<div class=\"exp-q\"><div class=\"exp-h\">1. 看拼音，写词语。</div><div class=\"exp-a\">天上　白云　水牛　木头　小鸟　书本</div><div class=\"exp-n\">一年级书写要求：字要写在田字格中间，先撇后捺、先横后竖，每个笔画都要写到位。</div></div>",
        "cls": "",
        "group": "q1",
        "role": "exp",
        "keepNext": false,
        "splittable": false,
        "label": ""
      },
      {
        "pid": "exp-q2",
        "html": "<div class=\"exp-q\"><div class=\"exp-h\">2. 把加点字的读音写在横线上。</div><div class=\"exp-a\">zhǎng　yuè　bái　niǎo</div><div class=\"exp-n\">声调要标在主要元音上：ao 标在 a，iu 标在 u，ui 标在 i。</div></div>",
        "cls": "",
        "group": "q2",
        "role": "exp",
        "keepNext": false,
        "splittable": false,
        "label": ""
      },
      {
        "pid": "exp-q3",
        "html": "<div class=\"exp-q\"><div class=\"exp-h\">3. 比一比，再组词。</div><div class=\"exp-a\">日子／目光　木头／书本　大人／入口</div><div class=\"exp-n\">「日」中间一横，「目」中间两横；「人」撇捺分开，「入」撇短捺长盖住撇。</div></div>",
        "cls": "",
        "group": "q3",
        "role": "exp",
        "keepNext": false,
        "splittable": false,
        "label": ""
      },
      {
        "pid": "exp-q4",
        "html": "<div class=\"exp-q\"><div class=\"exp-h\">4. 写话。</div><div class=\"exp-a\">参考范文：我的好朋友叫小明。下课以后，我们常常一起跳绳。</div><div class=\"exp-n\">一年级写话只要求写完整的一两句话，能加句号即可，不要求字数。</div></div>",
        "cls": "",
        "group": "q4",
        "role": "exp",
        "keepNext": false,
        "splittable": false,
        "label": ""
      }
    ],
    "warnings": []
  }
